"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>AOR Change — Non-IFT Case (Rejected)</title>\n\n  <!-- CDN fonts & icons -->\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\" integrity=\"sha512-d6lKqk9g3t2Gq1s3+1l8cVt0a8Zx4y5U0yWfKk2r7x2H5k1u2JqK7k6X6Q==\"\n    crossorigin=\"anonymous\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/bootstrap/5.3.2/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n\n  <style>\n    :root{\n      --bg:#f6f8fb;\n      --card:#ffffff;\n      --accent:#0d6efd;\n      --success:#198754;\n      --danger:#dc3545;\n      --personA:#ff6b6b;\n      --personB:#4dabf7;\n      --muted:#6c757d;\n      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial;\n    }\n    body { background:var(--bg); padding:24px; }\n    .card { border:0; border-radius:12px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(22, 28, 45, 0.06); }\n    .banner { display:flex; gap:16px; align-items:center; }\n    .status-badge { padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px; color:#fff; font-weight:600; display:inline-flex; gap:8px; align-items:center; }\n    .status-rejected { background:var(--danger); }\n    .case-id { font-weight:700; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.95rem; }\n    .person-pill { padding:10px 12px; border-radius:12px; color:#fff; display:inline-flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; font-weight:600; }\n    .personA { background:linear-gradient(90deg, #ff6b6b, #ff8a8a); }\n    .personB { background:linear-gradient(90deg, #4dabf7, #74c0fc); }\n    .summary-list li { margin-bottom:8px; }\n    .green { color:var(--success); font-weight:700; }\n    .red { color:var(--danger); font-weight:700; }\n    pre.email { background:#0b1220; color:#e6eef6; padding:18px; border-radius:8px; overflow:auto; }\n    .btn-copy { background:#0d6efd; color:#fff; border:0; }\n    .small-muted { color:var(--muted); font-size:0.92rem; }\n    .section-title { font-size:1.03rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px; }\n    .icon-large { font-size:1.4rem; }\n    .fold-toggle { cursor:pointer; color:var(--accent); font-weight:600; }\n    details summary { list-style:none; }\n    details[open] summary::after { content:\"▲\"; float:right; color:var(--muted); }\n    details summary::after { content:\"▼\"; float:right; color:var(--muted); }\n    footer { font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--muted); margin-top:18px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"card p-4 mb-4\">\n      <div class=\"banner\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"status-badge status-rejected\">\n            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark icon-large\" style=\"opacity:0.95;\"></i>\n            Rejected — Non-IFT Case\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start;\">\n            <div>\n              <div style=\"font-size:1.25rem; font-weight:700;\">Agent-of-Record Change — Automatic workflow stopped</div>\n              <div class=\"case-id mt-1\">Case / Contract: <strong>CONT10001</strong></div>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"text-align:right;\">\n              <div style=\"font-size:0.95rem; color:var(--muted)\">Marketing Director</div>\n              <div style=\"font-weight:700\">Arjun Sungisetty</div>\n              <div class=\"small-muted\">arjunshinde2@gmail.com</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Parties -->\n    <div class=\"row g-3 mb-3\">\n      <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n        <div class=\"card p-3\">\n          <div class=\"section-title\">PersonA (Current / Terminated)</div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center;\">\n            <div class=\"person-pill personA\">\n              <i class=\"fa-solid fa-user-slash\"></i>\n              Mark\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <div><strong>Name:</strong> Mark</div>\n              <div><strong>NPN:</strong> 3245556</div>\n              <div class=\"small-muted\">Status: Terminated (notification received)</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n        <div class=\"card p-3\">\n          <div class=\"section-title\">PersonB (Proposed New Agent)</div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center;\">\n            <div class=\"person-pill personB\">\n              <i class=\"fa-solid fa-user-check\"></i>\n              Raja\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <div><strong>Name:</strong> Raja</div>\n              <div><strong>NPN (provided):</strong> 23523523542</div>\n              <div class=\"small-muted\">Note: No license verification performed — case classified as non-IFT</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Summary of actions -->\n    <div class=\"card p-3 mb-3\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">Summary of actions performed</div>\n      <ul class=\"summary-list\">\n        <li><i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check green\"></i> Non-IFT detection run: <span class=\"green\">Detected</span></li>\n        <li><i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-xmark red\"></i> Automatic IFT-based AOR change: <span class=\"red\">Stopped</span></li>\n        <li><i class=\"fa-solid fa-envelope green\"></i> Email template prepared for carrier & marketing director: <span class=\"green\">Prepared</span></li>\n        <li><i class=\"fa-solid fa-file-lines red\"></i> License check (automated) for PersonB: <span class=\"red\">Not run due to non-IFT</span></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Email template -->\n    <div class=\"card p-3 mb-3\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">Email template — To send to carrier (corebridge_care@corebridge.com)</div>\n      <div class=\"small-muted mb-2\">Primary recipient: corebridge_care@corebridge.com • CC: arjunshinde2@gmail.com • Also notify: Raja (PersonB)</div>\n\n      <pre class=\"email\" id=\"emailContent\">\nSubject: Non-IFT — AOR Change Request for Contract CONT10001 (PersonA: Mark → PersonB: Raja)\n\nTo: corebridge_care@corebridge.com\nCC: arjunshinde2@gmail.com\n(Please also notify PersonB: Raja — email: raja@example.com  — replace with actual)\n\nCarrier Contact Team,\n\nWe have identified this case as a non-IFT scenario and are requesting your assistance to manually process an Agent-of-Record (AOR) change for contract CONT10001.\n\nCase summary:\n- Contract / Case ID: CONT10001\n- Current agent (PersonA): Mark — NPN: 3245556 (terminated)\n- Proposed new agent (PersonB): Raja — NPN (provided): 23523523542\n- Marketing Director / Requestor: Arjun Sungisetty — arjunshinde2@gmail.com\n\nReason for contact:\nThis case was flagged as non-IFT. Because the automatic IFT transfer process cannot be used, please treat this as a manual AOR change request and advise the specific documentation and next steps required by Corebridge to process the transfer.\n\nRequested actions from Carrier:\n1. Confirm receipt of this non-IFT AOR change request and update case CONT10001.\n2. Provide a list of required documents and signatories for manual AOR change. Typical items to confirm include:\n   - Completed & signed AOR change form\n   - Proof of termination or employer confirmation regarding PersonA\n   - Agent appointment/contract documents for PersonB (lines of authority)\n   - Current appointment status / licensing requirements (please confirm if any outstanding appointments or contracting required with Corebridge)\n   - Any additional carrier-specific forms or notarization requirements\n3. Confirm whether Corebridge requires any additional verification (errors/validation) for NPN 23523523542 or if our provided NPN needs correction.\n4. Provide an expected timeline for manual processing and any routing instructions (email, portal upload, fax) for submitting documents.\n\nGuidance for Marketing Director & PersonB:\n- Marketing Director (Arjun) will gather and upload/send the required documents once Corebridge confirms the list.\n- PersonB (Raja) should ensure licensing and appointments are in place for the product line(s) on CONT10001; please confirm requirements and supply any additional details Corebridge requests.\n- If a carrier-specific AOR form is required, please confirm whether signatures from PersonA are required or if the carrier will accept organizational/marketing director authorization due to termination.\n\nContact details for case follow-up:\n- Marketing Director: Arjun Sungisetty — arjunshinde2@gmail.com\n- Preferred response method: Email to corebridge_care@corebridge.com and CC arjunshinde2@gmail.com\n\nNotes:\n- This request was halted from automated processing due to classification as non-IFT. Please advise if Corebridge can convert this into a carrier-accepted manual AOR change and confirm next steps.\n- If you prefer, we can provide scanned copies of termination notice, AOR form, and agent appointment documents immediately upon your confirmation of required pieces.\n\nThank you,\nArjun Sungisetty (on behalf of Marketing Team)\nEmail: arjunshinde2@gmail.com\n      </pre>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-3 d-flex gap-2\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-copy\" onclick=\"copyEmail()\" title=\"Copy email to clipboard\"><i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy email</button>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-light\" href=\"mailto:corebridge_care@corebridge.com?cc=arjunshinde2@gmail.com&subject=Non-IFT%20—%20AOR%20Change%20Request%20for%20Contract%20CONT10001\" role=\"button\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-paper-plane\"></i> Open mail client</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Next steps & Confirmation (collapsed by default) -->\n    <div class=\"card p-3 mb-3\">\n      <details>\n        <summary class=\"section-title\">Next steps & Confirmation (click to expand)</summary>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\n          <ol>\n            <li><strong>Carrier action:</strong> Carrier acknowledges receipt and provides required document list and submission route.</li>\n            <li><strong>Marketing Director:</strong> Gather the requested documents (AOR form, termination documentation, agent appointment records) and submit as advised by carrier.</li>\n            <li><strong>PersonB (Raja):</strong> Verify licensing, appointment, and sign any required carrier forms. Provide a best contact email and phone.</li>\n            <li><strong>Carrier finalization:</strong> Carrier confirms approval and updates AOR to PersonB, then communicates confirmation to Marketing Director and our team.</li>\n          </ol>\n\n          <div class=\"mt-2\"><strong>Confirmation needed from Marketing Director:</strong></div>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Confirm PersonB’s correct email and phone for CCing and any e-signing links.</li>\n            <li>Prepare scanned termination proof for PersonA if requested.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- How this conclusion was reached (collapsed) -->\n    <div class=\"card p-3 mb-3\">\n      <details>\n        <summary class=\"section-title\">How this conclusion was reached (click to expand)</summary>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\n          <ul>\n            <li>Prompt contained explicit marker \"nonIFT\". A detection check flagged the case as non-IFT.</li>\n            <li>Per process rules, when a case is non-IFT we stop the automatic IFT AOR flow to avoid incorrect processing and instead route to manual/ carrier handling.</li>\n            <li>No automated license verification was run because the workflow is halted for manual carrier processing. The prompt also requested generating an email template to the carrier and to CC the marketing director — that has been prepared above.</li>\n            <li>Observed details: PersonB's NPN supplied (23523523542) appears unusually long compared to typical NPN lengths used in some systems — please confirm NPN formatting with the carrier (we flagged this in the email). Also PersonA NPN provided: 3245556.</li>\n          </ul>\n\n          <div class=\"mt-2\"><strong>Strange / noteworthy items observed</strong>\n          <ul>\n            <li>The prompt instructs to use NPN \"1234567\" for licenseCheck tool — but because this case is non-IFT, license check was intentionally not executed. If you want us to run the license check regardless, please confirm and provide explicit instruction to proceed.</li>\n            <li>PersonB's NPN (23523523542) may be malformed or outside expected range. Recommend carrier verification.</li>\n          </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer>\n      <div><strong>Result:</strong> Automated AOR change stopped — manual carrier handling required (Non-IFT)</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:6px;\" class=\"small-muted\">If you want me to proceed further (for example, run a license check using SID 1234567 or generate additional carrier-specific documents), reply with explicit confirmation and any missing contact/emails.</div>\n    </footer>\n  </div>\n\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/bootstrap/5.3.2/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n  <script>\n    function copyEmail(){\n      const text = document.getElementById('emailContent').innerText;\n      navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => {\n        alert('Email content copied to clipboard. Paste into your mail client to send.');\n      }).catch(()=>{ alert('Unable to copy — please select and copy manually.'); });\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>"